The workflow of the pipeline include the following steps:
1. Calculating co-accessibility between enhancers of a given gene
2. Formulating a network of signihifcantly correlated enhancers of a target gene
3. TE intersection with significant enhancer sequences of the target gene
4. Generate a TE-family-enahcner matrix and a TE-family-location-based TE-enahcner matrix as output
